usos5 (2026-10-09): a sampled read-back mismatch is counted and traced, never
a STOP (2000 Server SP4 on the X470 stopped with STOP 0x55534F53
(3, 43C81022, 2, 01E69238) at "Registering components": the compared buffer
is the caller's live pages, which may change while their write is in
flight). Applies to src/ in this folder.

